      <Placemark>
        <name>Street Heat</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gy7aZkNGkOKXJd914Ldg86Fgsh6moFXd6NAFg1JQNET8_ewObhqBNuSbUpuLH5TkC9U-LyaRxTk7CnV8vFETmdXqmnlpAMDRr09z4XVA3828h-PKNSzlXKQNxCQVxU0V4kqv6usN4LQFp4UdLZ0d-bFHmzk_0qTW2142ZmFWErMqdTmy-qluZJYK7eOvM9jXIMPJQEeTNsJIvmyYxnEFGEjmeRtp_dSlsmcqnEnST7ljLBYCE61T5AS0Ps?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>CHICKEN AL PASTOR TACOS: WITH JUICY MARINATED CHICKEN, SWEET & TANGY MANGO SLAW, FRESH CILANTRO, AND A BURST OF CITRUSY, SMOKY FLAVOR IN EVERY BITE.]]></description>
