      <Placemark>
        <name>Boke Bowl</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxfyEeHqMKj0nt-kHsYxFj6eGedZ-5lddeplcQ9mUZqeU36bxo0G0QJimtTQ1M-4Jrg_7N9f_zqgBJ6STAov9wZFqGSAvX6lhTbH2z5y7m0bl5-NLIPlb9SHgj2nmzmtxbLBB8ikbuSde9rG-CGguvgy8iv1xJLPSx58mNAqXyGrJNPfhC3qpIzSWx8gKny5NO5b1I3dhU47gSpk78xiSkw2YcOqgt5JTnr1pLDYGgHkgaw0XsnldkhWJI?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>AL LA PASTOR PORK TENDERLOIN STEAM BAO TACO: WITH PINEAPPLE KIMCHI SALSA. THE PORK TENDERLOIN IS MARINATED IN A SLURRY OF TOASTED CHILES, ACHIOTE PASTE, GARLIC, PINEAPPLE AND SPICES THEN GRILLED. THE MEAT IS STUFFED INTO OUR HANDMADE “TACO-SHAPED” BOA BUN AND TOPPED WITH A PINEAPPLE KIMCHI SERRANO CHILE SLAW<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GwQ_evo4Ifm0c151MSml2_3nnpmjk71V5uy9cW8fD2p0RMbLBc8Ct8xH6mQv1Bxp2vOc2USWID1q2gwHUxpwMmZf-VzJLxwrmgTh0uFL-rzOZuV-yz4UcoNyfqqjkrhdfn5A-8SJrZebFfAtXD3bcoMeOhSH8pFcYC1DaEDYmvBCg_UzPjCP4Ui7-REkx3AONNj7ykimvGJcvfGF2zhP6Cz43W6-b9JzdpFalMGkhrtEUaLtEeRjLgxmyM?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
